@startuml baseline-computation
title US-04: Baseline Computation - Historical Route Built from TimescaleDB

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam participantBorderColor #555555
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

participant "Position\nConsumer" as Consumer
database "TimescaleDB\nposition_history" as TSDB
database "TimescaleDB\nroute_baseline\n(continuous aggregate)" as Baseline

Consumer -> TSDB : INSERT INTO position_history\n{ entity_id, geo_cell, timestamp_ms, lat, lon }

note over TSDB
  Partitioned by (geo_cell, time_bucket).
  Each entity builds up a position
  history across many time chunks.
end note

TSDB -> Baseline : continuous aggregate refresh\n(time-bucket rollup per entity)

note over Baseline
  Materialised view updated automatically.
  Computes average track per entity
  per time bucket over the last N days.
  No full table scan on each evaluation.
end note

Baseline --> Baseline : route_baseline ready\n{ entity_id, time_bucket,\n  avg_lat, avg_lon, stddev_metres }

@enduml
